combo LBox: dark list items and scrollbar (issue #6000)

darkmodelib 0.75 still themes ComboLBox with DarkMode_Explorer, which
makes Find / Options / Custom Zoom drop-down items or their classic
scrollbars stay white. Untheme the list so WM_CTLCOLORLISTBOX can paint
items, hook GetSysColor while it paints, and draw the NC scrollbar.

Fixes https://github.com/sumatrapdfreader/sumatrapdf/issues/6000

Base: darkmodelib 0.75.0 (fa99647). Paths are relative to ext/darkmodelib.
